    "body": "Tracker: #106\n\nThis is a docs-only stacked plan PR based on the OWNER-approved spec branch. It does NOT mutate the approved spec HEAD and contains no executable implementation.\n\nApproved spec:\n- PR #107\n- HEAD `9c9f0ebbf2bd5d5dc5b21578718f1ef356e278f9`\n- OWNER approval issue comment `5448419150`\n- OWNER approval PR comment `5448420189`\n\nPlan decomposition:\n1. `2026-08-28-zb-communication-foundation-integration.md` — selective daemon + Reference Bridge provenance-safe integration; no #103 mutation and no canon import.\n2. `2026-08-28-zb-communication-orchestrator-v0.md` — strict protocol/router/receipt/read-back/idempotency/owner-view/Console TDD core.\n3. `2026-08-28-zb-communication-pr-remote-proof.md` — permanent draft Communication PR + Work webhook remote proof + explicit OWNER activation stop.\n\nSelf-review repaired abbreviated SHA references and conditional file-scope wording before opening this PR.\n\nPLAN_HEAD = 54d915d6138cb2cdc805bda44d70091d53c1da1b\nPLAN_BASE_SPEC = 9c9f0ebbf2bd5d5dc5b21578718f1ef356e278f9\nDIFF = DOCS ONLY / 3 FILES\nIMPLEMENTATION_CODE = NO\nPR_107_MUTATION = NO\nPR_103_MUTATION = NO\nAUTO_MERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO\nCANON_CHANGE = NO\nOWNER_LOCK = NO\n\nNEXT = plan CI -> DUNCAN plan review -> OWNER plan approval -> implementation execution",
